window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She's the mate he desires . . . He's the nightmare she wakes up to . . .</p> <p>He's a terrifying brute of a male that I can't help but fear.</p> <p>Ripped away from Earth and everything I know, I'm stuck in a lair of alien warriors, including him. The one that stares at me, threatens me. Hates me.</p> <p>Until he brings me his broken feather and asks me to mend him. What else can I do? Back home, I was a falconer, training and taming birds of prey.</p> <p>What are the chances I can tame this fearsome predator, before he decides I'm his next meal?</p> <p>Fear is a full length sci-fi romance novel from Hattie Jacks, the second in the Rogue Alien Warrior series. Two beings collide in this story of a woman hiding from her fears and an alien warrior who should face his. Steamy and delicious with no cheating, no cliffhanger, and always a HEA!</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
